stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reported: Department user reports issue
    Reported --> Acknowledged: Admin reviews
    Acknowledged --> Assigned: Admin assigns owner
    Assigned --> InProgress: Work begins
    InProgress --> AwaitingParts: Parts/info needed
    AwaitingParts --> InProgress: Parts/info received
    InProgress --> ReadyForTesting: Repair work complete
    ReadyForTesting --> Resolved: Result verified
    Resolved --> Closed: Admin closes issue
    Resolved --> InProgress: Test fails / more work needed
    Closed --> [*]
